 s+='Unlicensed assets remain evaluation-only outside the repository release (D1=A); detailed sources, mapping risks and prior raw examples are in the retained operational appendix.\n\n'
 s+='## E4: donor availability and proposed matched-pairs analysis\n\n**3/5 cases (60%) have any eligible donor/control pair within ±10%; 2/5 have all three.** Overall availability is 7/15 pairs (46.7%), after the closest-token donor re-pilot improved 6/15. Each pair’s full eligible donor set was inspected; most cases have one donor. Failures are length mismatch or no unused next unit, not a relaxed tolerance.\n\n'
 groups=defaultdict(lambda:[0,0,0])
