 s+='Seed 43 is on only in `rebuttal/configs/E4-P-full.json`; pilot configs remain off. Cluster seed 43 outcomes by underlying task. E2-A’s projected $22.70 is 200 candidate workloads, not kept injections; planned $9.61 assumes about 120 kept. N80’s pending +31.5 h is not silently added to approved totals. OpenRouter prices remain the saved 2026-11-08 snapshot; both reports use the same calculator.\n\n'
