 s+='## Settings changes for approval\n\n- **N80: planned, pending author confirmation (+31.5 h).** Fact presence primary; fidelity accuracy reported; fidelity κ and preselected AC1 secondary; fixed lexical stratified draw/weights.\n- **Partial-as-lost sensitivity: planned, pending author confirmation.** Primary excludes partial/uncertain; sensitivity includes partial as lost.\n- **E4: planned, pending author confirmation.** Closest-token donor order and matched-pairs-only contrasts, with explicit group coverage and unchanged ±10%.\n- **Scoring:** v4 follows the authors’ source-based instruction: released code-only primary, strict sensitivity. No renderer change is proposed.\n\n## Verification and lead handoff\n\n**289 tests pass**, including an AC1 hand-calculated example, actual pinned R1 scorer behaviour, and recursive blindness checks over the packet itself. No new paid calls this turn. The N80 AC1 simulation is complete; no experiment worker remains. Send the wave-1 packet now, but do not claim that the aggregation reserve or final 12 casebook is complete. Those are explicit remaining dependencies, not manufactured labels.\n\n'
