 x=load(O/'ac1_process.json');s+=f"Completed simulation PID **{x['pid']}**: `{' '.join(x['command'])}`; log `{x['log']}`. Packet export: `python -m scripts.prepare_author_packet`; conditional wave2/casebook export: `python -m scripts.finalize_author_packet`.\n\n"
